        {
          "page": "2",
          "section": "3.1",
          "quote": "The EDS results of the gray phase A showed that it contains 33.5% Al and 51.7% Ti (at. %). The Ti3Al phase has a molar ratio of Ti to Al between 3.2:1 and 1.5:1 from the Ti–Al binary phase diagram and Ref. [17,18]. Combined with the XRD results, phase A was deduced to be Ti3Al.",
